   "id": "adv_adventure_revaulting",
   "reason": "The vanilla advancement (open an ominous vault with an ominous trial key) needs trial chambers and an ominous trial. Rebuilt as the hunter's supper (a cow, a steak, a campfire). The real vault trail belongs to level 5 or 6."
  },
  {
   "id": "adv_adventure_lighten_up",
   "reason": "The vanilla advancement (a copper bulb, lit with an axe) sits in trial chambers. Rebuilt as the hunter's light (a redstone torch on a fence, torches left alone at night). A copper-bulb trail can follow at level 5."
  },
  {
   "id": "adv_adventure_overoverkill",
