 "generatorWeaknesses": [
  "No SHOOT goal. Every hunt is a DEFEAT_ENTITY / LOOK_AT_ENTITY with a HOLDING bow, crossbow, shield, axe or spear, so no step can check that an arrow was shot or that it hit. A SHOOT goal would need: the weapon (bow, crossbow, trident), the projectile (arrow, trident), a target (an entity, or a block such as the target block), the hit (the sensor must see the projectile owner and the hit entity or block), an optional minimum distance (멀리), a count, and for \"two with one arrow\" a pierce count. A THROW goal needs the same for the trident.",
  "AVOID cannot take an entity action. AVOID with DEFEAT_ENTITY (주민을 물리치지 마세요) loads and plays, but ObtainabilityTest.everyGoalTargetIsARealVanillaId looks the entity up as a block or item and fails. All AVOID steps here use BREAK_BLOCK, USE_BLOCK and LIE_DOWN.",
  "The AVOID signature leaves out `during`, so two AVOID steps on the same action and block are duplicates however different their condition is (a chest opened near a wolf equals a chest opened near a piglin).",
  "EQUIP on a slot tag (#minecraft:head_armor) is not playable in PlaytestTest (\"did not advance\"); a concrete helmet works.",
  "DEFEAT_ENTITY with count 1 prints \"한 마리\", which adds the numeral 하나 to the unknown words of a level-3 sentence. A singular without a counter would be easier on the unknown-word ratchet.",
  "The (verb, object) pair ratchet leaves nearly no room for a hunter chapter: PLACE torch is at its cap of 7, KINDLE campfire at 6, and every mob may appear only three times in all the trails. Hunt trails had to spread over twelve mobs and animals.",
  "REACH_HEIGHT above 100 blocks always prints the hint 산 위로 올라가요, so a condition that already says 산에서 would double it.",
  "A held tool is the only link between the tool and the hunt. HOLD_WHILE and HOLDING cannot say \"with the bow\" for a hit (활로 맞히다), so (으)로 for the instrument (L3.euro_instrument) appears only in authored finales.",
  "cooked_beef is 스테이크 in the vanilla ko_kr names, but the curated concept (and the generator) say 소고기. The finales follow the generator.",
  "The trident (drowned drop) and the wolf taming (bone) cannot be required reliably: the first is a rare drop, the second can fail. The wolf trail feeds meat instead of taming with a bone."
 ]
}
